		(uuid "55900202-e69f-599b-a23f-b6ec11ae02db")
	)
	(text "Input: the pin through 100k to the ADC; with the 20k leg grounded (default) 15 V reads 2.5 V, with DIRECT high the range is 0-2.5 V. BURDEN adds 120 R for 4-20 mA loops; PULLUP (range switch sheet) adds 10k to +3V3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 21 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7a853fd4-30f8-5e73-803c-6b1babc0ca9e")
	)
	(text "SENSOR SUPPLY AND CONNECTOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 208.28 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a2723f15-b68c-50fe-9de2-807f6e12a26c")
	)
	(text "MEASUREMENT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 132.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bd0ec1f7-0786-54d0-b81e-702dd1bc220f")
	)
	(text "Every control line is pulled to its off level, so the channel is high impedance with the sensor supply off until firmware sets the expander."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f214b13c-2e9c-5930-831b-85970bdb9af5")
	)
	(text "Universal I/O channel 4: connector pin 1 = switched sensor supply, 2 = signal, 3 = GND. Output: DAC level x 4.83 from a TSB582 section through a switch (IO Output Drivers sheet), up to 100 mA, open while OUT_EN is low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "fc924060-d01a-5b27-9f98-25bcab00304c")
	)
